+++ Release 0.5.5 (2009-03-18) +++

2009-03-18 Guido Scholz <guido.scholz@bayernline.de>
	* spdrs60/main.cpp, mainwindow.cpp: Only first application
	window is session leader and has a quit function.

2009-03-15 Guido Scholz <guido.scholz@bayernline.de>
	* spdrs60/element.*, gbsarea.*, paintitemwindow.cpp: New WHT
	element implemented to switch occupied turnouts.

